message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "norm-arith: Certified automation for analytic estimates in Lean"
authors:
  - family-names: Ortega
    given-names: Tomas
repository-code: "https://github.com/TomasOrtega/norm-arith"
url: "https://github.com/TomasOrtega/norm-arith"
version: "0.2.0"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  An independent Lean package for norm arithmetic and analytic estimates.
  Exact search proposes certificates checked by Lean. The project includes
  standalone proof benchmarks, mathematical documentation, and an extensible
  architecture for seminorms, operator estimates, and PDE estimate composition.
keywords:
  - Lean
  - formal verification
  - norm arithmetic
